units metal
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
atom_modify map yes
read_data /misc/home6/u3129/tial-testsets/pbe15k-melting-1775-20261026-01/T1775K/cool/final.data nocoeff
pair_style deepmd /misc/home6/u3129/tial-testsets/pbe15k-melting-1775-20261026-01/model_15000.pt2
pair_coeff * * Ti
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 10 check yes
timestep 0.001
compute 2 all pe/atom
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step time atoms temp pe ke etotal press pxx pyy pzz vol lx ly lz
thermo_modify flush yes lost error
